# The Hush — the deep wood: D minor darkening to E flat, no wind, no birds; low strings, voices on
# an open fifth, the shadows' motif (D, E flat, D, the A below) on a low clarinet. Original, cb17
# (2026-10-29). 6 bars of 4/4 at 60: 24 s, a loop; its first 300 ticks are the silence while the
# cold den is unlit (R-cb17-1 A).
title The Hush
cue replace fade 9
tempo 60
meter 4/4
part deep strings pp pan -15 gain 10
part voices choir pp pan 15 gain 7
part shadow clarinet p pan 30 gain 7
bar 1
deep D2,A2/1~
voices D4,A4/1~
bar 2
deep D2,A2/1
voices D4,A4/2 Eb4,A4/2
shadow D4/4 Eb4/4 D4/2
bar 3
deep D2,A2/1
voices D4,A4/1
shadow A3/1
bar 4
deep Bb1,F2/1
voices Bb3,F4/1
bar 5
deep A1,E2/1
voices A3,E4/2 A3,Eb4/2
shadow D4/4 Eb4/4 F4/4 Eb4/4
bar 6
deep D2,A2/2. r/4
voices D4,A4/2. r/4
shadow D4/2. r/4
